# Generated, large or reproducible: take frames and MP4s, renders, synthesized sound.
# Rebuild with record/*.mjs (see README). Kept in git because the film imports them:
# public/take/<name>/cues.json (times and tap positions only) and shots/out/*.png (synthetic).
public/take/*/frames/
public/take/*/frames.txt
public/take/*/take.json
public/take/*/take.mp4
public/take/*/fatal.png
public/out/
public/sfx/
# Scratch voice files (record/voice-say.mjs rebuilds them); manifest.json is kept.
public/vo/*.wav
